{
  "__data_type": "GIC ",
  "Creature List": {
    "type": "list",
    "value": [
      {
        "__struct_id": 4,
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": "Talk to him to:\r\n\r\n- Sells drinks and food to Night Guards\r\n- Will tell Night Guards how to find rooms to rest\r\n- Share rumors on the road\r\n- Will give a hunt job to Night Guards of Rank 1 & 2"
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 4,
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": "Talk to her to:\r\n\r\n- Will share town gossip with anyone who talks to her (gives some lore information on the Fairy Fountain)\r\n- Will share town gossip about people in town\r\n- Will send players on fetch quest, herbs, and meat for the guild's stores (if a player does each of her quests three times, she will give a \"Token\" to players to advance to Rank 1 or 2)\r\n- Male character of 4th level and higher, and are Heartlandic, will be told to talk to her grand daughter (this will guide players to Billy to do her quests, but she is also trying to set them up with her)"
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 4,
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": "Talk to him to:\r\n\r\n- Join Night Watch\r\n- Hired a Night Guard for a length of time\r\n- Advancement"
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 4,
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": "Talk to her to:\r\n\r\n- She will offer the same refreshments as her father at the bar.\r\n- She will ask players about places outside of her town, and will express a dream of see some of the world one day.\r\n- She will express a curiosity about magic, stating how she wishes people in town were more open minded, and that the Gurd might be made better if they embraced magic more\r\n- Players who did the work for Martha will have a quest open with Billy. While they were sent to court her, she will turn the conversation on its head by sharing a \"curious little thing\" that she found in the well bucket, and that there is apparently \"a lot of them lately.\" Taking this back to Prasinos, Jo'Jirr will identify it. Returning to Billy after giving the item to Jo'Jirr, she will wonder if the items are related to the Old Burrow north of town (players who have ran the Old Burrow may pick up Old Relics, these can be brought back to Jo'Jirr, and he will connect the burrows to be somehow connected to the Elven Ruins in the west).\r\n- Following the events with the Elven Ruins and Jo'Jirr's research, characters can return to Billy to share their experience with her. This will satisfy her wonder lust, as she \"had a little adventure of my own without trying.\"\r\n- Players cna return to Billy several times on their adventure to tell her about their stories. Players who come back to tell her stories following her event will be given items that will give them the Well Fed buff for free (only works once)."
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 4,
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
